  "description": "Erection of single-storey extension lower ground floor,&nbsp; roof extension and external alterations&nbsp;",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed mansard roof extension, by reason of its detailed design, size, bulk, and position,&amp;nbsp;would result in an incompatible and obtrusive form of development within an unbroken roofline that would adversely affect the character and appearance of the host building and the terrace it forms part of. As such, the proposal would be contrary to policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020), policies D3 (&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-172b7060-7fff-fba5-6489-716e8da1c167&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;and D4 (Delivering good design) of the London Plan (2021), and Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
